    PARTY `the court` DOES `exercise the powers set out in Article 14(2)` AT 9

§§ `C3: the office of Commissioner is vacant and no relevant person is designated -- nobody is acting -- and the court's power on the Commissioner's application is not open (IP28)`

GIVETH A `Contravention case`
`the case of the governor who acted, with the office vacant` MEANS
    `Int fx the contravention case with there is a vacancy in the office of Commissioner replaced` `the case of the governor who acted after reporting` TRUE

#ASSERT NOT (`Int (c) what follows from the contravention` fleet (YMD 2026 4 1) `the case of the governor who acted, with the office vacant`)'s `someone is acting as the Commissioner`
#ASSERT NOT (`Int (c) what follows from the contravention` fleet (YMD 2026 4 1) `the case of the governor who acted, with the office vacant`)'s `the powers of the court under Article 14 are exercisable on the Commissioner's application`
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Int (c) the court may exercise its powers on the Commissioner's application` fleet (YMD 2026 4 1) `the case of the governor who acted, with the office vacant` AT 0 WITH
    -- no events
-- A relevant person designated by the Minister while the office is vacant is treated as the Commissioner (Schedule 1 paragraph 4(5)): the power is open again.
