`the case of the governor who acted, with the office vacant and a relevant person designated` MEANS
    `Int fx the contravention case with a relevant person has been designated under sub-paragraph (4) replaced` `the case of the governor who acted, with the office vacant` TRUE
#ASSERT (`Int (c) what follows from the contravention` fleet (YMD 2026 4 1) `the case of the governor who acted, with the office vacant and a relevant person designated`)'s `someone is acting as the Commissioner`
#ASSERT (`Int (c) what follows from the contravention` fleet (YMD 2026 4 1) `the case of the governor who acted, with the office vacant and a relevant person designated`)'s `the powers of the court under Article 14 are exercisable on the Commissioner's application`

§§ `C4: the charity failed to comply with a required steps notice -- Article 16(1)(c) -- and the Commissioner deregisters it; what follows (Article 17)`

-- A required steps notice for misconduct was sent on 10 January 2026 and received on 12 January; the date of service is the date of receipt on the favoured reading of F7.7, 12 January; the time it specifies is 30 days
-- after that, to 11 February 2026; the steps have not been taken. By 15 June 2026 the charity has failed to comply with it (Article 16(1)(c), reading F6.19: once the time the notice names has run out).
GIVETH A `Notice served in the case`
`the required steps notice that was not complied with` MEANS
    `Notice served in the case` WITH recipient IS `the registered charity`, belief IS `there has been misconduct by a registered charity`, `date sent` IS YMD 2026 1 10, `date received` IS JUST (YMD 2026 1 12), `date fixed by an Order under Article 38` IS NOTHING, time IS `a period of days fixed by the notice` 30, requirements IS EMPTY, `the steps required have been taken` IS FALSE

GIVETH A `Register entry in the case`
`the register entry of the school company with the notice` MEANS
    `Int fx the register entry with notices served replaced` `Int fx the register entry of the school company` (LIST `the required steps notice that was not complied with`)

GIVETH A `Deregistration of the entity`
`the deregistration of 15 June 2026 for failing to comply with the notice` MEANS
    `Deregistration of the entity` WITH
        route IS `by written notice under Article 16(1) on the ground that the entity has failed to comply with a required steps notice`
        `date of the deregistration` IS YMD 1999 1 1
        `date of the preliminary notice` IS JUST (YMD 2026 5 1)
        `the Commissioner is satisfied that the grounds have existed since` IS NOTHING
        `past date specified in the deregistration notice` IS NOTHING
        `past date specified in the preliminary notice` IS NOTHING
        `the Commissioner determines that the deregistration takes effect retrospectively` IS FALSE

-- The deregistration notice was sent on 12 June and received on 15 June 2026: the date it was served is the date of receipt on the favoured reading of F7.7 (Article 38), 15 June 2026 -- the date recorded
-- in the deregistration record (1 January 1999) is a placeholder that the integration layer replaces by the date of service.
GIVETH A `Deregistration in the case`
`the deregistration in the case, notice received on 15 June 2026` MEANS
    `Deregistration in the case` WITH deregistration IS `the deregistration of 15 June 2026 for failing to comply with the notice`, notice IS `Notice of a decision in the case` WITH `date sent` IS YMD 2026 6 12, `date received` IS JUST (YMD 2026 6 15), `date fixed by an Order under Article 38` IS NOTHING

GIVETH A `Contravention case`
`the case of the charity that failed to comply with the notice` MEANS
    `Int fx the contravention case with deregistration replaced` (`Int fx the contravention case with preliminary notice replaced` (`Int fx the contravention case with charity replaced` `the case with no contravention` `the register entry of the school company with the notice`) (JUST `Int fx a preliminary notice given on 1 May 2026 with objections to 31 May`)) (JUST `the deregistration in the case, notice received on 15 June 2026`)

#ASSERT (`Int (c) what follows from the contravention` fleet (YMD 2026 6 15) `the case of the charity that failed to comply with the notice`)'s `a ground of Article 16(1) for deregistration exists`
-- Ground (c) only: a charity that meets the charity test, so (a) does not hold.
#ASSERT (`Int (c) what follows from the contravention` fleet (YMD 2026 6 15) `the case of the charity that failed to comply with the notice`)'s `the entity meets the charity test`
-- Asked about 1 February 2026, before the time the notice names ran out (11 February), the charity has not yet failed to comply: no ground.
#ASSERT NOT (`Int (c) what follows from the contravention` fleet (YMD 2026 2 1) `the case of the charity that failed to comply with the notice`)'s `a ground of Article 16(1) for deregistration exists`
-- Article 17: the basis is the failure to comply with the notice (IP32); the deregistration is not retrospective, so the date from which it takes effect is its own date, 15 June 2026; the Commissioner must retain
-- the information for 10 years, to 15 June 2036 on the favoured readings (F6.5: from the date of the notice; F6.18: the last day is the anniversary).
#ASSERT ((`Int (c) what follows from the contravention` fleet (YMD 2026 6 15) `the case of the charity that failed to comply with the notice`)'s `the effects of the deregistration`) EQUALS JUST (`Effects of a deregistration` WITH `the basis of the deregistration` IS `the entity has failed to comply with a required steps notice`, `date deregistered` IS YMD 2026 6 15, `the deregistration takes effect retrospectively` IS FALSE, `last day on which the Commissioner must retain the information` IS YMD 2036 6 15)

-- The power to deregister (Article 16(1)): open on 15 June 2026 (the preliminary notice of 1 May ran its time on 31 May); not yet open on 15 May 2026 (the objections period had not ended).
-- EXPECT: STANDING MAY
#TRACE `Int (c) the Commissioner may deregister the entity` fleet (YMD 2026 6 15) `the case of the charity that failed to comply with the notice` AT 0 WITH
    -- no events
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Int (c) the Commissioner may deregister the entity` fleet (YMD 2026 6 15) `the case of the charity that failed to comply with the notice` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES `deregister the entity by written notice` `the Commissioner` AT 3
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Int (c) the Commissioner may deregister the entity` fleet (YMD 2026 5 15) `the case of the charity that failed to comply with the notice` AT 0 WITH
    -- no events

