#ASSERT (`Int (c) what follows from the contravention` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) `the case of a school company with a disqualified director`)'s `the reportable matters of each governor` EQUALS LIST (`Reportable matters of a governor` OF "A. Le Brun", (LIST `a disqualification order or other restriction on acting as a governor imposed under this Law`))
